# RidgeWatch environment template (orientation only).
#
# Two runtimes read two different files. Do not duplicate variable names here:
#
#   frontend/.env.local   public browser values (see frontend/.env.example)
#                         VITE_API_BASE_URL, VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY,
#                         VITE_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#
#   backend/.env          server-only values (see backend/.env.example)
#                         RIDGEWATCH_MODE, RIDGEWATCH_ENVIRONMENT,
#                         CORS_ORIGINS, SUPABASE_URL,
#                         SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
#
# No credentials are required to run the labelled demo. Never commit a filled
# env file, and never put SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY in a VITE_ variable.
# Run `python scripts/check_env.py` to see which names are present or missing.
